[E0204] Error: TYPE MISMATCH: `+` adds numbers; to concatenate text, use `&`
   ╭─[ text_plus.sim:1:20 ]
   │
 1 │ begin text t; t := "a" + "b"; end;
   │                    ────┬────  
   │                        ╰────── try `"a" & "b"`
   │ 
   │ Help 1: write `"a" & "b"`
   │ 
   │ Help 2: suggestion: replace `+` with `&`
   │ 
   │ Note: text concatenation is `&` (Standard §3.5)
───╯
